# This app doesn't read API keys from .env — add them in Settings
# (http://localhost:3000/settings) once it's running. They're stored in
# local/db.sqlite, not here. Idea gate and Ideation board work with zero
# keys, always. Reel analyzer's metadata/hooks/frames do too — a Groq key
# just adds a transcript. Reddit radar and Voice need real setup (see
# /docs once the app is running): Reddit radar needs a free Reddit OAuth
# app, Voice needs one of an API key, a logged-in Claude Code CLI, or a
# local Ollama server.
#
# This file exists only in case a future tool needs a root-level env var.
